    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "The proposed framework uses BO to optimize the bonded parameters of a CG molecular structure, focusing on capturing the critical degrees of freedom that influence vital macroscopic properties like density and radius of gyration. The optimization process involves a low-dimensional parametrization of the CG molecular topology, which balances computational efficiency with the need to capture key topological features.",
