    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "The optimized CG topologies show superior performance compared to the raw Martini3 topology, with significant reductions in absolute percentage errors for density and radius of gyration across various polymers and degrees of polymerization. The framework demonstrates its generalizability and effectiveness in reducing discrepancies between CGMD and all-atom molecular dynamics simulations.",
