    {
      "title": "Why It Matters",
      "content": "The proposed framework has the potential to bridge the gap between low- and high-fidelity MD models, enabling accurate predictions with CGMD at a fraction of the computational expense of all-atom simulations. This can have significant implications for various fields, including materials science, chemistry, and biology, where molecular simulations play a crucial role in understanding complex phenomena and designing new materials.",
